{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00791",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 1.07,
      "end_seconds": 21.08,
      "duration_seconds": 20.01,
      "text": "Doctor, this is Mia, nine, from Hillside Primary. Mrs Ward, the school nurse's assistant, I'm her helper today, because her dad couldn't come. I've got his consent form and the notes he wrote. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.25,
      "end_seconds": 29.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.19,
      "text": "Thanks, and welcome. Mia, you've been having ear problems, haven't you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.84,
      "end_seconds": 36.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Yes. My ear hurts, and I can't hear Miss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.42,
      "end_seconds": 40.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Which ear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.19,
      "end_seconds": 46.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "The left one. Sometimes the right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 48.42,
      "end_seconds": 58.52,
      "duration_seconds": 10.1,
      "text": "Dad's notes say she's had five ear infections this year, and she's been shouting at the telly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.23,
      "end_seconds": 66.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "How long has the left ear been sore this time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.42,
      "end_seconds": 70.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.71,
      "end_seconds": 77.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "Mia, do you get a fever, or a runny nose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.28,
      "end_seconds": 85.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "No fever. My nose is a bit blocked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 87.66,
      "end_seconds": 99.1,
      "duration_seconds": 11.44,
      "text": "The notes say she's on drops and tablets. Let me read. Olive oil drops, and a nose spray, and the tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.67,
      "end_seconds": 104.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Which ones, can you read me the names?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 106.25,
      "end_seconds": 124.59,
      "duration_seconds": 18.34,
      "text": "The nasal spray is fluticasone, one spray each nostril once a day. The tablets are cetirizine, 5 mg once a day, and the drops are olive oil, two drops at night in the left ear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.01,
      "end_seconds": 130.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Does she have any allergies, to medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 133.41,
      "end_seconds": 135.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Dad's written, no allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.61,
      "end_seconds": 140.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "And any other problems?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 142.85,
      "end_seconds": 146.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Hay fever, he's written that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.31,
      "end_seconds": 157.66,
      "duration_seconds": 8.35,
      "text": "Mia, I'm going to look in your ears with my torch. It might tickle. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.07,
      "end_seconds": 178.03,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.03,
      "end_seconds": 190.48,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "The left eardrum is red and bulging, and there's no hole. The right eardrum is dull, with fluid behind it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 193.67,
      "end_seconds": 196.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Is that the infection? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.78,
      "end_seconds": 213.84,
      "duration_seconds": 14.06,
      "text": "Yes, a left ear infection, and fluid in the right ear, which is likely a glue ear. I can't rule out hearing loss from the fluid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.19,
      "end_seconds": 220.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Is it going to hurt? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.46,
      "end_seconds": 234.15,
      "duration_seconds": 12.69,
      "text": "It'll be sore for a couple of days. I'm going to prescribe an antibiotic for the left ear, and your dad can collect it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 236.82,
      "end_seconds": 241.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Do I write that down for him? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.32,
      "end_seconds": 260.68,
      "duration_seconds": 17.36,
      "text": "Please tell him, and I'll put it on the record. Mia has had five infections this year, so I'd like to arrange a hearing test, and I'll refer her to the ENT team to talk about grommets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 263.7,
      "end_seconds": 266.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "What are grommets? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.91,
      "end_seconds": 276.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.77,
      "text": "Tiny tubes in your eardrum, so the ears drain, and you can hear. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 279.79,
      "end_seconds": 282.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "I don't mind. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 283.52,
      "end_seconds": 287.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Dad will be pleased about the referral. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.7,
      "end_seconds": 299.04,
      "duration_seconds": 8.34,
      "text": "I'd like to see Mia again in four weeks, to check the right ear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 302.2,
      "end_seconds": 306.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "I'll write that on the form. ~"
    }
  ]
}
